    <div class="hwaet-project-intro">
      <p>
        A standalone short film adapted from the first act of the planned
        feature film, <em>Drag Me to Winchester</em>, following a medieval
        charcoal burner through a three-day charcoal burn in the New Forest
        towards his destined discovery of the dead body of King William Rufus.
      </p>
    </div>
