	<p>
The charcoal burn also became a piece of practical research for our planned feature Drag Me To Winchester. Learning to operate and film the kiln revealed things about timing, smoke, continuity, safety and coverage that could not be understood fully from research alone, and that knowledge will feed directly into the larger production.
	</p>

